cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'To cite package "fly" in publications use:'
type: software
license: MIT
title: 'fly: Historic Airphoto Footprints, Selection and Georeferencing for British
  Columbia'
version: 0.14.1
abstract: Estimate ground footprints from airphoto centroids and scale, compute coverage
  of areas of interest, select minimum photo sets using greedy set-cover, fetch scans
  and flight metadata from the BC Data Catalogue, and georeference the images onto
  their estimated footprints.
